{"catalogHash":"9b61e25e4b3ab6b03de3cdf4a596bd440566c4e37005c9524d39027c299eea8e","contract":"cerebro.node-modifier-detail/v2","definition":{"id":"pve_take_bait","versions":[{"applications":[{"evidence":{"coordinate":{"x":8,"y":5},"pointer":"/map/walkableTiles/19/defenderBuffs/5","sourceId":"map-beecc05659a5b437ea84-2026eb5a"},"hash":"19c67acf45c1600a2bd9ca63de793668ffd896f0dd68cda8c57cfe3bba5a4350","nativeIconKey":null,"observations":3,"raw":{"buffAmount":1,"buffAppearance":"”","buffDescription":"When the Attacker lands a second Medium Attack they gain an indefinite Root Charge. Max: 8. While above 4 Charges and if the Defender is not Rooted, the final hit of the Attacker's Special and Heavy Attacks places a Trap at their feet.\\n\\nIf the Defender passes over this Trap, the Attacker spends 4 Root Charges to Passively [k=glossary/root]Root[/k] the Defender for 5 seconds. The Root ends immediately on the first hit of the Attacker's Special Attacks. While Rooted and above 2 Bars of Power, the Defender is inflicted with a 90% [k=glossary/suppression]Suppression[/k] Passive.\\n\\nWhenever this Root triggers, the Attacker gains an indefinite Hunter Charge, each reducing the duration of incoming [k=glossary/breach]Breach[/k] Debuffs by 30% (up to 90%), grants +6% [k=glossary/physical_pen]Physical Penetration[/k], and causes hits to deal an additional 50% of the [k=glossary/real_damage_dealt]real damage dealt[/k] as a burst of Energy Damage. Max Stacks: 10. Additionally, while at 5+ Hunter Charges, the Attacker deals Guaranteed Critical Hits.","isExtra":false,"nodeSource":{"attk":false,"bt":[],"buffs":[{"Action":"","Data":"pve_take_bait","Footer":"","Header":"","MaxQuantity":1,"MinQuantity":1,"Quantity":1,"Type":"buff"},{"Action":"","Data":"pve_despair_3","Footer":"","Header":"","MaxQuantity":1,"MinQuantity":1,"Quantity":1,"Type":"buff"},{"Action":"","Data":"avx_atk_pct_50","Footer":"","Header":"","MaxQuantity":1,"MinQuantity":1,"Quantity":1,"Type":"buff"}],"remainActive":false,"type":{"name":"Local","value":2}}},"text":"When the Attacker lands a second Medium Attack they gain an indefinite Root Charge. Max: 8. While above 4 Charges and if the Defender is not Rooted, the final hit of the Attacker's Special and Heavy Attacks places a Trap at their feet.\\n\\nIf the Defender passes over this Trap, the Attacker spends 4 Root Charges to Passively [k=glossary/root]Root[/k] the Defender for 5 seconds. The Root ends immediately on the first hit of the Attacker's Special Attacks. While Rooted and above 2 Bars of Power, the Defender is inflicted with a 90% [k=glossary/suppression]Suppression[/k] Passive.\\n\\nWhenever this Root triggers, the Attacker gains an indefinite Hunter Charge, each reducing the duration of incoming [k=glossary/breach]Breach[/k] Debuffs by 30% (up to 90%), grants +6% [k=glossary/physical_pen]Physical Penetration[/k], and causes hits to deal an additional 50% of the [k=glossary/real_damage_dealt]real damage dealt[/k] as a burst of Energy Damage. Max Stacks: 10. Additionally, while at 5+ Hunter Charges, the Attacker deals Guaranteed Critical Hits."}],"componentIds":["pve_rol_rhino_dummy_ui","pve_rol_rhino_chrg_hud","pve_rol_rhino_chrg_add","pve_rol_rhino_tv_corner_check","pve_rol_rhino_corner_var","pve_rol_rhino_corner_var_up","pve_rol_rhino_corner_var_down","pve_rol_rhino_dummy_timer","pve_rol_rhino_tv_switch","pve_rol_rhino_tv_wall","pve_rol_rhino_tv","pve_rol_rhino_tv_rmv_wall","pve_rol_rhino_tv_rmv_norm","pve_rol_rhino_seq","pve_rol_rhino_var_cons","pve_rol_rhino_root","pve_rol_rhino_tv_rmv","pve_rol_rhino_supp","pve_rol_rhino_supp_mana_a","pve_rol_rhino_supp_mana_b","pve_rol_rhino_supp_rmv","pve_rol_rhino_rmv_root_sp","pve_rol_rhino_lock_chance","pve_rol_rhino_hunter_hud","pve_rol_rhino_hunter_charge","pve_rol_rhino_brch_dur","pve_rol_rhino_phys_pen","pve_rol_rhino_g_crit","pve_rol_rhino_nrg_dmg"],"components":[{"hash":"e7ef5328db87ecc6a16c614321a246ca488edc0fc5350ed57cbde82f6ce464e7","id":"pve_rol_rhino_dummy_ui",